(83, 'Remplacer ma carte', '💳 Votre demande de remplacement de carte a été reçue. Un conseiller va bloquer votre ancienne carte et en émettre une nouvelle. Elle sera disponible dans votre espace client sous quelques minutes.', '2026-06-05 23:20:13', NULL, 163, 'Imane Swiry', NULL, '4034144486691488', NULL, 'EN_ATTENTE'),
(84, 'Problème avec mon compte', 'Sure, I can provide you with some information on the problem you may be experiencing with your KBC (Belgium) account. The \"4034144486691488\" is your KBC (Belgium) account number. Please make sure to double-check that this is the correct account number and not any other number that could be used for your KBC account. Also, ensure that you are logging in using the same email address that was registered with your bank or using a secure connection when accessing your online banking services. If you are still experiencing issues, please contact your bank\'s customer service for further assistance. Thank you for bringing this to our attention.', '2026-06-05 23:20:19', NULL, 163, 'Imane Swiry', NULL, '4034144486691488', NULL, 'NORMAL'),
